Plate mail is very heavy and generally best avoided if there is any choice 
at all.

>    T - an uncursed +0 helmet (being worn)

Did you just wear the first equipment you found? In the early game, you 
should be checking every item of armour to see if it's cursed then wearing 
it if it's not. You never know when you might find a +5 pair of soft 
shoes...

