If you had IDd the wand of fire, you could have used it to engrave Elbereth 
on the floor. This would have stopped many ceatures from hitting you, 
including fire ants. You could have used the wand of digging too, although 
engravings made by a wand of digging can get distorted by walking on it.

Do you know how to engrave-id wands? Write something in the dust with your 
fingers, then engrave with the wand over it - the message will help you to 
determine what it might be. Some messages can be given by more than one 
wand, so take care.

